# Confidential peer reviews / meta-reviews — never commit (double-blind
# anonymity + review confidentiality). Catch-all covers "<venue> [meta ]review *.md".
report/*review*.md
report/neurips review *.md
report/icml review *.md

# All NeurIPS review-period correspondence and notes (reviews, meta-reviews,
# rebuttal drafts, replies, handoffs, OpenReview PDF exports) are confidential.
report/NeurIPS/
report/neurips_rebuttal.md
report/rebuttal_*.md

# Regenerable per-window prediction / analysis artifacts (dump_window_predictions.py,
# run_level_detection.py). Large and reproducible on any machine from data/ + code;
# the computed numbers live in report/neurips_rebuttal.md.
classifier/results/window_preds/
classifier/results/window_predictions.parquet
classifier/results/*_cv_combined.parquet
